{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新想能承担什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他亲身试过，真去做能让自己从无力里动起来，可那股力气没能让他放下对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"从无力里动起来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又想怪自己不够坚定，可他真舍不得停下争取，也舍不得失去那种生活带来的安慰。光靠怀念护不住眼下珍惜的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"光靠怀念护不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到要付出的代价，他心里还是疼，盼着别失去太多，可眼前该争取的事不能一直搁着。\",\n      \"key\": \"别失去太多\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他还没想出两边都顾到的办法，也怕失去安宁，却不再要求自己先不害怕才肯动，还是先做眼前该争取的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"不害怕才肯动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留选边的逼迫松动后，他仍没把握，却开始重新想自己还能承担什么，解释前进为何从试探开始。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并保留限制\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动曾使他从无力中动起来的经验，同时明确这份力量不能消除对那种生活的牵挂；行动带来的力量与未解的压力可以同时存在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\", \"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并行动与旧愿都舍不得、自责和两种珍惜之间的牵制，补回他又想怪自己不够坚定、却发现两样都真舍不得的认识；保留怀念无法保护现实中所珍惜之物的限制，并由S06-4、S07-2提供前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想到代价时的心疼、盼望少失去一些，以及眼前的事不能一直搁置；删去重复的等待无用之理，让不行动的代价落在他眼前仍需争取的事情上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补回\",\n      \"why\": \"把恐惧仍在与实际开始承担合成一个决定，补回他不再要求自己先不害怕才肯动；保留尚未找到两全办法、仍怕失去安宁，却先做眼前该争取之事的意思。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "df4dbd70-c67d-4a64-bcea-5712fe42f53d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T201650937473Z", "elapsed_seconds": 304.063, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T20:21:55.016554+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "002dd62712a74f53e2aed408fa5158d300a5503ae0dc07a561b3d044616aa0a3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1ef